% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% The fields of a listing (the jewellery listing format)
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"item type" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Item Type (72 listings): the kind of product in the seller's words".
"type" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Type (12 listings): a kind of product".
"bracelets type" is a field of the kind bracelet,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Bracelets Type, Earring Type, Rings Type, Chain Type, Lace Wig Type: the kind of bracelet, earring, ring, chain or wig".
"earring type" is a field of the kind earring,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Bracelets Type, Earring Type, Rings Type, Chain Type, Lace Wig Type: the kind of bracelet, earring, ring, chain or wig".
"rings type" is a field of the kind ring,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Bracelets Type, Earring Type, Rings Type, Chain Type, Lace Wig Type: the kind of bracelet, earring, ring, chain or wig".
"lace wig type" is a field of the kind wig,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Bracelets Type, Earring Type, Rings Type, Chain Type, Lace Wig Type: the kind of bracelet, earring, ring, chain or wig".
"metals type" is a field that names the metal,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Metals Type (69 listings): the metal".
"metal stamp" is a field that names the metal,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Metal Stamp (8 listings): the hallmark".
"main stone" is a field that names the gem,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Main Stone (18 listings) and Side Stone (10 listings): the stones".
"side stone" is a field that names the gem,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Main Stone (18 listings) and Side Stone (10 listings): the stones".
"human hair type" is a field of human hair,
    as stated in the jewellery listing format, confer "Human Hair Type (24 listings), Hair Grade (17 listings), Material Grade (8 listings)".

